# IT Support Knowledge Base

## Purpose

This repository contains generic IT support procedures, troubleshooting guidance, and operational instructions.

No confidential, personal, customer, financial, or infrastructure-specific information may be stored in this repository.

---

## Approved Content

- Troubleshooting procedures
- Service desk workflows
- Escalation guidelines
- Application support guides
- Vendor-neutral support instructions
- Hardware support procedures
- Printer troubleshooting
- Ticket management processes
- Operational best practices

---

## Restricted Content

Do not store:

- Passwords
- MFA codes
- API keys
- Tokens
- Private certificates
- Employee information
- Customer information
- Financial information
- Internal URLs
- Internal server names
- Internal hostnames
- Internal IP addresses
- VPN configurations
- Security architecture
- Database connection details
- Confidential company information
- Customer contracts
- Supplier contracts
- Project documentation

---

## Repository Rule

If information would not be safe to publish publicly, it must not be added to this repository.

When in doubt, do not publish it.
